      "trackName": "Arrow Out Tap Watch Game",
      "description": "Think carefully. Find the open path. Free every arrow.\n\nArrow Out Tap Watch Game is a directional logic challenge designed for quick and satisfying play on your wrist. Tap arrows in the correct order, avoid blocked paths, and clear the entire board.\n\nFEATURES\n\n• 1,000 handcrafted levels\n• Simple one-touch controls\n• Increasing puzzle difficulty\n• Smooth movement and completion effects\n• Sound and haptic feedback\n• Zoom and pan controls\n• Progress saved automatically\n• Fully playable offline\n• No advertisements\n• No account required\n• No tracking or data collection\n\nEvery move matters. A blocked arrow costs a heart, so examine the board and plan your solution before tapping.\n\nCan you clear every path?",
